Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.51,0:00:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马：完全束手无策…》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.37,0:00:18.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗：那就如你所愿…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的 No.卡我就全部收下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.41,0:00:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的灵魂就由我来狩猎！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.26,0:00:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《凭现在的我赢不了那家伙》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《星光体：那场战斗完全是我输了》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:33.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连你的灵魂一起，由我来狩猎！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.37,0:00:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.41,0:00:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破灭的光子流… 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.60,0:00:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗就先记着！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.13,0:00:48.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.85,0:00:50.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《那时候如果决斗没有被打断{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.55,0:00:54.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就会消失》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.92,0:00:58.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（打鼾）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.62,0:01:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.65,0:01:04.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好痛…… 啊 嘿嘿嘿嘿。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.54,0:01:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《星光体……》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.06,0:01:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说、说到底都是因为你附到我身上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.60,0:01:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}害得连我都被盯上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.80,0:01:18.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成了被夺魂的目标啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.32,0:01:19.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.66,0:01:22.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎… 我说 啊 真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.86,0:01:24.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你消沉个什么劲啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.05,0:01:26.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们想活下去的话 就只能{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.40,0:01:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打倒那家伙 打倒快斗了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.45,0:01:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我能赢吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.98,0:01:37.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以说～ 不是能不能赢是要赢啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.18,0:01:39.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这已经不只是你一个人的问题了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.41,0:01:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.38,0:01:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟 铁男。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.58,0:01:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世界决斗嘉年华？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.11,0:01:50.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）嗯 简称WDC。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.14,0:01:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下次 在心园要在心之地举办哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.17,0:01:55.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场狂欢节上，会有来自世界各地的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.53,0:01:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}强得离谱的决斗者
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.95,0:01:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}聚集过来呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.73,0:02:02.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这么说来　那家伙也…》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.26,0:02:06.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.46,0:02:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）喂　游马　你怎么了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.66,0:02:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.68,0:02:13.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊　奶奶！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.04,0:02:16.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（春）其实啊　想让你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.69,0:02:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}帮忙跑个腿来着。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.77,0:02:21.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这…　这是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.35,0:02:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…　我现在　没那个心情…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.31,0:02:27.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦？　我那乖巧可爱的孙子{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.18,0:02:29.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跑哪儿去了呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.74,0:02:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在…　在！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.55,0:02:35.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这里！　您的孙子在～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.93,0:02:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼　呼…。

Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.12,0:02:57.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！　哪里是什么跑个腿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.39,0:03:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的小事啊　奶奶！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.17,0:03:05.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊——已经走不动了……唔……。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.22,0:03:07.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这点程度就怂了，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.25,0:03:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天的招牌你居然给摘下来了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.11,0:03:11.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.86,0:03:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是从我身上拿走一飞冲天{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.48,0:03:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还能剩下什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.66,0:03:19.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是一飞冲天啊～我！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.22,0:03:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.24,0:03:28.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊 哈啊 哈啊……。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.81,0:03:34.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.18,0:03:38.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总觉得这地方好脏啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.72,0:03:40.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.93,0:03:45.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.58,0:03:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.47,0:03:50.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}猴子 猴子 猴子……是山猴啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.01,0:03:53.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看 这里 这里 这里！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.70,0:03:56.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（六十郎）哦哦 欢迎光临小可爱。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.74,0:03:57.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.22,0:03:59.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是猴子，是老头？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.22,0:03:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Comment: 0,0:00:00.75,0:00:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,------------op--------------
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.23,0:05:39.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}噗哇～。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.59,0:05:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真好吃啊，小鸟酱。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.94,0:05:45.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊～再差一点就要饿死了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.64,0:05:48.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也得感谢春小姐，感谢感谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.17,0:05:50.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}春小姐跟我奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.27,0:05:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是什么关系啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.37,0:05:54.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咿嘻嘻嘻！嘛，各方面都
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.53,0:05:56.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受过她不少照顾哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.25,0:05:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小春小姐啊，嘻嘻嘻…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.95,0:06:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃！什、什么啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.98,0:06:02.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个老头。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.14,0:06:04.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是老头！老夫是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.71,0:06:08.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这决斗庵的主人，六十郎。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.39,0:06:12.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（3人）决斗庵！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.60,0:06:14.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.29,0:06:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你让游马去决斗庵了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.62,0:06:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）为什么！？游马已经不能再
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.40,0:06:19.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是让他深入决斗的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.66,0:06:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我都说了那么多次会有危险连老爸也……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.36,0:06:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯……那家伙虽然还不太成熟{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.40,0:06:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但一定能在决斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.50,0:06:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}找到真正的目的吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.61,0:06:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真正的目的？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.96,0:06:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（3人）哎～！？回不去了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.65,0:06:38.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。已经没有巴士了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.51,0:06:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}天一黑，这附近的人可全都睡了哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.71,0:06:44.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎、怎么会这样！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.23,0:06:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛不嫌弃的话，就在这儿睡吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.76,0:06:49.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说是说睡这儿～。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.45,0:06:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这种脏兮兮的地方谁睡得着啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.81,0:06:56.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嚯嚯嚯嚯！不劳动者不得食……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.28,0:06:59.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对，是不劳动者不得睡才对。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.21,0:07:01.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，等等啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.32,0:07:12.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男，那个麻烦你搬到里面去。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.68,0:07:13.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.46,0:07:17.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！偷懒可不行哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.22,0:07:18.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，好麻烦啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.91,0:07:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么非得打扫啊，那老头……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.03,0:07:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.45,0:07:27.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说起来，那老头是走进这里面了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.39,0:07:36.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑、黑、黑魔导！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.28,0:07:41.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}青眼白龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.81,0:07:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害！真红眼新宇侠！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.85,0:07:50.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连黑魔导女孩都有！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.38,0:07:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}传说中的怪兽全都聚齐了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.09,0:07:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太厉害了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.44,0:07:58.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的游马，又偷懒……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.30,0:08:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么啊！？这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.15,0:08:01.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.22,0:08:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.35,0:08:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嚯嚯嚯……吓到了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.05,0:08:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这座木像，是老夫倾注灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.75,0:08:11.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}制作出来的决斗怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.44,0:08:13.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有一个弟子出师
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.98,0:08:17.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老夫就会做一座木像。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.32,0:08:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}弟子？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.83,0:08:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，这座决斗庵{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.69,0:08:22.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是作为决斗的修行场而繁荣起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.68,0:08:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有着悠久传统的草庵。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.74,0:08:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这里，许许多多有名的决斗者
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.43,0:08:30.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成长了起来哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.28,0:08:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎～好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.97,0:08:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这座怪兽木像感觉随时都会动起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.01,0:08:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会动的哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.86,0:08:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会动，木像会动！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.03,0:08:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.72,0:08:43.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然，是在决斗中哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.93,0:08:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要试试吗？嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.14,0:08:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.55,0:08:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR视界 连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.76,0:09:01.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.94,0:09:02.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（六十郎）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.47,0:09:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双方的场地上 已经{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.80,0:09:07.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}传说的4只被召唤出来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.67,0:09:09.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我这边是 青眼雕像龙和
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真红眼雕像龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.54,0:09:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你那边是 雕像黑魔导和
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.07,0:09:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}雕像黑魔导女孩。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.26,0:09:22.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用的卡组是 我决斗庵特制的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.06,0:09:23.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}木制卡组。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.32,0:09:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 传说的4只怪兽也
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.35,0:09:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 仍然是木像。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.37,0:09:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}它们的力量 被封印着攻击力是零。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.73,0:09:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法攻击哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.42,0:09:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊！那果然不还是动不了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.29,0:09:40.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也可以说会动也可以说它不动。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.32,0:09:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就要看你自己了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.17,0:09:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.84,0:09:46.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《看游马的了…原来如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.05,0:09:50.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在决斗中，一切都取决于玩家的战术》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.25,0:09:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，场上的怪兽是有效果的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.45,0:09:53.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.16,0:09:55.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有关键的卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.30,0:09:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应该都沉睡在卡组里。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.32,0:09:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在卡组里…？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.70,0:10:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.39,0:10:04.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.99,0:10:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你先攻哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.42,0:10:12.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好，上了。我的回合。抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.14,0:10:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这个吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.62,0:10:18.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动场地魔法 B2区域。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.37,0:10:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.82,0:10:21.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张场地魔法 B2区域{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.40,0:10:25.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是解除雕像怪兽封印的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.10,0:10:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）哦～。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.54,0:10:37.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}动起来吧，怪兽们。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.33,0:10:50.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（黑魔导）哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.54,0:10:55.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（黑魔导女孩）呵呵。哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.36,0:11:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔～太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.73,0:11:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}传说中的怪兽们终于能驱动起来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.60,0:11:18.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害。有真红眼还有青眼白龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.72,0:11:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.31,0:11:21.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞。上吧，黑魔导。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.70,0:11:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击真红眼。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.02,0:11:26.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑·魔·导。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.08,0:11:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嚯嚯还挺能干的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.45,0:11:34.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了。有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.97,0:11:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，这样真的算是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.42,0:11:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}驱动了怪兽们吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.20,0:11:42.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你、你在说什么啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.77,0:11:45.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才不是用黑魔导破坏了真红眼吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.75,0:11:50.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵 接下来才是真正的决斗哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.12,0:11:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.48,0:11:58.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜 哇啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.36,0:12:02.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.76,0:12:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《哇啊。 哎？ 这是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.65,0:12:12.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.51,0:12:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会 我变成了黑魔导？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.72,0:12:19.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 变成怪兽了？》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.48,0:12:28.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《怎么会》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.67,0:12:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.36,0:12:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我 变成怪兽了？》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.55,0:12:36.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 上了哦。 我的回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.92,0:12:39.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 魔法卡 融合。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.48,0:12:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从场地和手牌将3只青眼白龙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.22,0:12:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送去墓地融合哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.57,0:12:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧 融合召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.93,0:12:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}青眼究极龙 雕像龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.67,0:13:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用那个 究极龙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.83,0:13:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击黑魔导女孩。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.56,0:13:10.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}究极爆裂。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.96,0:13:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.35,0:13:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑魔导女孩！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.45,0:13:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.56,0:13:29.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再从手牌发动速攻魔法融合解除。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.27,0:13:31.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将融合怪兽送回额外卡组{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.80,0:13:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把作为融合素材的怪兽们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.96,0:13:37.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.18,0:13:41.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧3只青眼白龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.42,0:13:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，住手。快住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.49,0:13:53.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错当强大的事物出现在眼前时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.86,0:13:56.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}任何人都会恐惧战栗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.05,0:13:59.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是理所当然的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.58,0:14:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击那家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.77,0:14:03.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.45,0:14:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽也是一样的。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.98,0:14:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让它们知道怪兽也始终暴露在这份恐惧之中。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.20,0:14:11.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.89,0:14:14.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只青眼白龙对黑魔导……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.40,0:14:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，直接攻击游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.10,0:14:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毁灭的爆裂疾风弹！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.63,0:14:28.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.76,0:14:35.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.84,0:14:40.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来是吓唬得有点过头了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.32,0:14:45.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你刚才感受到了怪兽的恐惧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.03,0:14:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那也就是说你明白了怪兽的心意。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.74,0:14:52.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白怪兽的心意并试图去回应它。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.44,0:14:56.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正是这份心意才能真正驱动怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.82,0:15:00.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白心意，回应心意……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.53,0:15:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《怪兽也同样在感受恐惧{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.39,0:15:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且试图跨越它吗……》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.08,0:15:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.93,0:15:27.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！你要到什么时候打算一直待在这里啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.80,0:15:30.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想回去就回去吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.99,0:15:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我再在这儿待一会儿。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.53,0:15:38.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 我去给你做早饭哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.06,0:15:40.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦… 哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.94,0:15:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈～。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.17,0:15:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.10,0:15:53.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？ 什么啊 这道伤？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.04,0:15:56.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然被弄得这么惨到底是哪个混蛋干的？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.08,0:16:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这不是被劈成两半之后又给接上了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.86,0:16:11.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《那孩子确实有资质。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.23,0:16:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光辉的资质…》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.25,0:16:16.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和那家伙正好相反…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.11,0:16:19.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗川：呜哦哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.89,0:16:30.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 你这家伙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.25,0:16:34.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我回来了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.79,0:16:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}师父。
Comment: 0,0:00:00.75,0:00:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,----------------CM----------------
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.93,0:16:40.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}师父，我回来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.63,0:16:46.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗川，你这家伙变得比以往更加黑暗了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.34,0:16:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让我来把您拖进去吧拖进黑暗之中。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.26,0:16:57.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.64,0:17:02.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.87,0:17:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等、等一下，你是谁啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.57,0:17:11.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.15,0:17:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.95,0:17:13.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.67,0:17:15.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爷……爷爷！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.48,0:17:17.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快逃，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.67,0:17:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}逃？这家伙到底是谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.20,0:17:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我以前的弟子。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.61,0:17:30.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.14,0:17:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.90,0:17:35.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么要主动追求黑暗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.67,0:17:37.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有光明的强大{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.53,0:17:41.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连自己也会毁灭这件事你都不明白吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.22,0:17:43.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.75,0:17:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.78,0:17:48.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗川 你干什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.49,0:17:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.02,0:17:57.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我还会回来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.08,0:18:01.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.60,0:18:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到那时 我会打倒你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.13,0:18:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 把决斗庵代代相传的秘传卡组拿到手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.52,0:18:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我赢了你。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.38,0:18:15.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗庵的秘传卡组 在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.74,0:18:18.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎能交给你这种人。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.28,0:18:19.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.44,0:18:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还不明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.98,0:18:26.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被黑暗夺去心智的蠢货！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.34,0:18:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.38,0:18:33.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我就把一切统统斩碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.08,0:18:34.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.43,0:18:36.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 你干什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.78,0:18:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.97,0:18:39.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是什么人！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.98,0:18:41.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么要妨碍我！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.50,0:18:43.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我… 我是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.75,0:18:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是 爷爷的弟子！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.89,0:18:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.24,0:18:52.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 那个老家伙的弟子？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.07,0:18:52.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笑死人了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.78,0:18:56.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}侮辱师父的人我绝不原谅！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.31,0:18:57.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.46,0:19:00.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你也吞入黑暗之中吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.34,0:19:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.75,0:19:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.64,0:19:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR影像 连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.17,0:19:18.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.02,0:19:19.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加油… 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.72,0:19:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 我也要战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.80,0:19:24.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊～？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.25,0:19:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不是在消沉吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.10,0:19:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也曾经受过那位老人的教导。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.13,0:19:31.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我也算是弟子。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.15,0:19:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，先攻就归我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.35,0:19:36.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.37,0:19:38.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤嘎嘎嘎魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.73,0:19:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（嘎嘎嘎魔术师）哦哦～！哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.44,0:19:45.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再盖放一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.81,0:19:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.00,0:19:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤机甲忍者 火焰！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.37,0:19:55.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（火焰）火～焰！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.91,0:19:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再从手牌发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.80,0:20:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机甲忍法 快速传送！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.31,0:20:05.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将机甲忍者 火焰的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.92,0:20:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力以下的1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.19,0:20:09.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.98,0:20:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，机甲忍者 空气！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.24,0:20:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（空气）咻！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.26,0:20:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据快速传送的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.94,0:20:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}炎和艾尔不能攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.42,0:20:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.31,0:20:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级4的怪兽有2只！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.17,0:20:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级4的机甲忍者 炎和
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.89,0:20:25.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机甲忍者 艾尔叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.54,0:20:28.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）开火！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.23,0:20:29.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.37,0:20:31.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.25,0:20:32.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.73,0:20:36.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 机甲忍者 刃心！！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.84,0:20:42.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽超量又召唤出来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.87,0:20:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个速度 绝非等闲之辈。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:48.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用机甲忍者 刃心攻击我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.77,0:20:51.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（刃心）哈啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.63,0:20:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续陷阱 打开！ 我我我护盾！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.01,0:20:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 将成为场上的魔法师族
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.90,0:21:00.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只怪兽的装备{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.88,0:21:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备给我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.40,0:21:07.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}劈开吧，电磁拔刀！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.28,0:21:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霞斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.14,0:21:11.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我护盾会
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.24,0:21:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我我我魔术师免受两次战斗破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.86,0:21:17.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，这份锋利你得接下。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.38,0:21:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.25,0:21:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，机甲忍者 刃心一回合一次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.96,0:21:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.41,0:21:31.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以再次攻击怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.86,0:21:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再次接下这份锋利吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.05,0:21:35.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.59,0:21:36.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.75,0:21:40.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.62,0:21:42.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蠢货，你要是不去保护怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.91,0:21:44.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就不会吃到伤害了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.83,0:21:47.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！怪兽是我的同伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.69,0:21:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同伴现在正克服恐惧战斗着！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.06,0:21:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此我会彻底保护好同伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.10,0:21:56.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同伴？无聊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.74,0:21:58.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连同那份心意一起{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.47,0:22:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的怪兽，就由我来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.08,0:22:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}劈成两半，砍个稀碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.00,0:22:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少开玩笑了！我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.63,0:22:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对不会让你得逞！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.27,0:22:16.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗，开始吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.13,0:22:18.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜小鸟：本周的问题！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.32,0:22:20.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开始决斗时的手牌是几张呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.52,0:22:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}4张？5张？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.45,0:22:24.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是6张？＞
Comment: 0,0:00:00.75,0:00:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-----------------ED-----------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.39,0:24:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}答案是5张。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.09,0:24:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组上方抽5张卡作为手牌{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.96,0:24:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗，开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.98,0:24:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是先攻的话别忘了之后的抽卡哦！

